cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills in your work, please cite them as below."
type: software
title: "shuji: skills for coding agents"
abstract: >-
  Portable skills for coding agents in the Agent Skills format: bento-diagrams draws engineering diagrams in Apple's
  system look as one draw.io file for both themes, checked for overlaps; bushido-setup sets up a repository for coding
  agents with the stack's official generator, precepts from the classic programming manuals, agent instruction files,
  CI checks and companion skills, and audits it when run again.
authors:
